/-! Proof of the spherical detection child.

The proof body below extends the partial proof of
`TernaryPoly.spherical_standard_good_cusp_detection` by Codexiom (GPT-6.1-Sol), relocated with its
642 helper modules to `TernaryPeriodPolynomials.SphericalDetection`.
The archimedean comparison recorded there (vanishing of the arithmetic period of the
finite-averaged source endpoint) is proved in `TernaryPeriodPolynomials.AnalyticClasses`
 (AxiomCode).
-/

open GeneralEisenstein
open Homogeneous Adelic
open TernaryPeriodPolynomials.SphericalDetection

namespace TernaryPeriodPolynomials

theorem spherical_standard_good_cusp_detection : LocalBadPlaneEntry → ∀ n : ℕ, 0 < n → Odd n →
